{"text": "From: Chaput, Elizabeth\n\nSent: Monday, April 20, 2020 4:11 PM.\nSubject: ROLL CALL - Employee Wellness/Support Info: Virtual Dental Care for State Employees\nAttachments: CIGNA Dental Virtual Care FLYER\n\n(30462794-442d-43b4-9c95-1edc2f8e99d9)_Teleden Flyer.pdf\n\nTO: All DOC Staff\n\nPlease see the following and attached information from the State Comptroller regarding the CIGNA Virtual Dental Care\nresource for state employees.\n\nDistrict Administrato\n\nPlease ensure this information is provided through Roll Call al facilities, all shifts,\n\n\u2018Thank you, for Executive staff ~\nLiz Chaput\nDeputy Commissioner's Office\nOperations and Rehabilitative Services\nCT Department of Correction\nWebsite: www.ct.aov/doc\n\nSent: Monday, April 20, 2020 12:56 PM\nSubject: Virtual Dental Care for State Employees\n\nDear State Employee,\n\nI'm pleased to announce that Cigna has been selected to stay on as the dental administrator for state\nof Connecticut employees, retirees and their dependents. The selection process was highly\ncompetitive and will allow the state to continue providing comprehensive plan options for you while",
